==Russian==
{{wp|ru:}}

===Etymology===
Cognate with {{cog|cu|юсеница}}, {{cog|uk|гу́сениця}}, {{cog|bg|гъсе́ница}}, {{cog|sh|гу̏сеница}}/{{l|sh|gȕsenica}}/{{l|sh|гу̏сјеница}}/{{l|sh|gȕsjenica}}, {{cog|sl|gosẹ̑nica}}, {{cog|cs|housenka}}, {{cog|sk|húsenica}}, {{cog|zlw-opl|wąsienica}}, {{cog|pl|gąsienica}}, {{cog|hsb|husańca}}, {{cog|dsb|guseńca}}. Probably from {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*ǫsěnica}}. The initial {{m|ru||г-}} is prothetic or by conflation with Common Slavonic {{m|cu|гоущерица||lizard}} ({{m+|ru|я́щерица}}), and is not related to {{m|ru|гусь|t=goose}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|гу́сеница}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-гусеница.ogg}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|гу́сеница|a=ai|dim=гу́сеничка|adj=гу́сеничный}}

